{"id":"kenntnis","lemma":"Kenntnis","pos":"noun","rank":3538,"glosses":["knowledge","skills","awareness"],"ipa":"/ˈkɛntnɪs/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/37/De-Kenntnis.ogg/De-Kenntnis.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Kenntnis","plural":"Kenntnisse"},"examples":[{"text":"Wen sollte ich in Kenntnis setzen?","en":"Who should I inform?","words":[{"g":"who","l":"wer"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to sit down"}]},{"text":"Nach meiner Kenntnis wird er nicht kommen.","en":"To the best of my knowledge, he will not come.","words":[{"g":"after / to"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to come"}]},{"text":"Es hat mich niemand in Kenntnis gesetzt.","en":"No one told me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78501","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to sit down","l":"setzen"}]},{"text":"Er hat nur oberflächliche Kenntnisse zu dem Thema.","en":"He has only a superficial knowledge of the subject.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"superficial","l":"oberflächlich"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"topic, subject, issue"}]},{"text":"Wir sollten sie darüber in Kenntnis setzen.","en":"We should inform them about that.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"above"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"to sit down"}]}]}